const modelKinds={hu:{molecule:'Molekulaszerkezet',lattice:'Ionrács / képletegység (szemléltetés)',metal:'Fémrács részlet',network:'Kovalens atomrács részlet',polymer:'Polimerlánc részlet'},de:{molecule:'Molekülstruktur',lattice:'Ionengitter / Formeleinheit (schematisch)',metal:'Metallgitter-Ausschnitt',network:'Kovalentes Netzwerk-Ausschnitt',polymer:'Polymerketten-Ausschnitt'}};
let currentMaterialModel=null;
function modelNotice(m){
 const box=$('modelNotice');if(!box)return;
 if(!m){box.classList.add('hidden');return}
 box.classList.remove('hidden');box.dataset.kind=m.kind;
 const msg=m.kind==='molecule'
 ? bilingual('A rajz 2D molekulaszerkezet; a pontos térgeometria eltérhet.','Die Zeichnung zeigt eine 2D-Molekülstruktur; die räumliche Geometrie kann abweichen.')
 : bilingual('FIGYELEM: szemléltető részlet, nem önálló molekula. A kötésvalidátor nem alkalmazható közvetlenül erre a rács-/láncmodellre.','ACHTUNG: schematischer Ausschnitt, kein isoliertes Molekül. Der Molekülvalidator ist auf dieses Gitter-/Kettenmodell nicht unmittelbar anwendbar.');
 box.textContent=modelKinds[lang][m.kind]+' — '+msg;
}
function modelToPreset(model){
 const atoms=model.atoms.map(a=>[a[0],Number(a[1]),Number(a[2])]);
 let edges=model.edges.map(e=>e.map(Number));
 if(!edges.length&&['lattice','metal'].includes(model.kind)&&atoms.length>1){
  // Nearest-neighbour schematic contacts. Not chemical bond orders.
  const distances=[];for(let i=0;i<atoms.length;i++)for(let j=i+1;j<atoms.length;j++){
   const d=Math.hypot(atoms[i][1]-atoms[j][1],atoms[i][2]-atoms[j][2]);if(d>1)distances.push([i,j,d]);
  }
  const min=Math.min(...distances.map(x=>x[2]));
  edges=distances.filter(x=>x[2]<=min*1.15).map(([a,b])=>[a,b,1,model.kind==='metal'?'metallic':'ionic']);
 }
 return {atoms,edges};
}
function materialModel(i){return materialStructures[i]||(materials[i]?.structure||null)}
function registerMaterialModel(i){
 const model=materialModel(i);if(!model)return null;
 const key='MAT_'+i; presetData[key]=modelToPreset(model);
 if(!$('presets').querySelector('option[value="'+key+'"]')){
  const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=materials[i][lang]+' · '+materials[i].f;$('presets').appendChild(o)
 }
 return key;
}
function refreshMaterialModelOptions(){for(let i=0;i<materials.length;i++)registerMaterialModel(i)}
function activateMaterialModel(i){
 let key=registerMaterialModel(i);if(!key)return;
 currentMaterialModel=materialModel(i);
 tab='molecule';render();
 requestAnimationFrame(()=>requestAnimationFrame(()=>{
  centerPreset(key);modelNotice(currentMaterialModel);
  const cv=$('molCanvas');cv.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
 }));
}
// User-provided JSON schema v1: {schemaVersion:1,materials:[{id,hu,de,f,category,type,description,structure:{kind,atoms:[[symbol,x,y]],edges:[[from,to,order]]}}]}.
const allowedMaterialCategories=new Set(['molecule','gaz','sav','bazis','so','fem','szerves','halozat','nemfem','polimer','keverek']);
const allowedModelKinds=new Set(['molecule','lattice','metal','network','polymer']);
const validSymbols=new Set(elements.map(e=>e.s));
function validateImported(m){
 if(!m||typeof m!=='object'||Array.isArray(m))throw Error('Material must be an object');
 if(!/^[a-z0-9_-]{2,80}$/i.test(m.id||''))throw Error('Invalid id');
 for(const key of ['hu','de','f'])if(typeof m[key]!=='string'||!m[key].trim()||m[key].length>160)throw Error('Invalid '+key);
 if(!allowedMaterialCategories.has(m.category))throw Error('Invalid category');
 if(!m.structure||!allowedModelKinds.has(m.structure.kind))throw Error('Invalid structure.kind');
 const a=m.structure.atoms,b=m.structure.edges;
 if(!Array.isArray(a)||a.length<1||a.length>250)throw Error('atoms must contain 1–250 entries');
 if(!Array.isArray(b)||b.length>400)throw Error('Too many edges');
 a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(!Array.isArray(v)||v.length!==3||!validSymbols.has(v[0])||!v.slice(1).every(n=>Number.isFinite(n)&&Math.abs(n)<=10000))throw Error('Invalid atom at '+i)});
 b.forEach((v,i)=>{if(!Array.isArray(v)||v.length!==3||!v.slice(0,2).every(n=>Number.isInteger(n)&&n>=0&&n<a.length)||v[0]===v[1]||![1,2,3].includes(v[2]))throw Error('Invalid bond at '+i)});
 const description=Array.isArray(m.description)&&m.description.length===2&&m.description.every(x=>typeof x==='string'&&x.length<1200)?m.description:['Importált anyag.','Importierter Stoff.'];
 return {id:m.id,hu:m.hu,de:m.de,f:m.f,category:m.category,type:m.type||m.structure.kind,description,structure:{kind:m.structure.kind,atoms:a,edges:b,note:String(m.structure.note||'').slice(0,500)}};
}
let importedMaterials=[];
function applyImportedMaterials(list){
 for(const incoming of list){let index=materials.findIndex(x=>x.id===incoming.id);
  if(index>=0&&index<68)throw Error('Reserved built-in id: '+incoming.id);
  if(index<0){index=materials.length;materials.push(incoming)}else materials[index]=incoming;
  materialStructures[index]=incoming.structure;registerMaterialModel(index);
 }
}
function importLibrary(obj,persist=true){
 if(!obj||obj.schemaVersion!==1||!Array.isArray(obj.materials)||obj.materials.length>250)throw Error('Expected schemaVersion:1 and materials array (max 250)');
 const batch=obj.materials.map(validateImported);const ids=new Set(batch.map(m=>m.id));if(ids.size!==batch.length)throw Error('Duplicate IDs');
 applyImportedMaterials(batch);
 importedMaterials=[...new Map([...importedMaterials,...batch].map(m=>[m.id,m])).values()];
 if(persist){try{localStorage.setItem('chemistryImportedMaterialsV1',JSON.stringify(importedMaterials))}catch(e){/* file storage unavailable */}}
 $('importStatus').textContent=bilingual('Betöltve: ','Importiert: ')+batch.length;
 renderMaterials();return batch.length;
}
$('importMaterialsBtn').onclick=()=>$('importMaterialsInput').click();
$('importMaterialsInput').onchange=async ev=>{
 const file=ev.target.files?.[0];if(!file)return;
 try{let obj=JSON.parse(await file.text());importLibrary(obj)}catch(err){$('importStatus').textContent='JSON: '+err.message}
 ev.target.value='';
};
$('clearImportedBtn').onclick=()=>{
 materials.splice(68);for(const k of Object.keys(materialStructures))if(Number(k)>=68)delete materialStructures[k];
 for(const k of Object.keys(presetData))if(/^MAT_\d+$/.test(k)&&Number(k.slice(4))>=68)delete presetData[k];
 $('presets').querySelectorAll('option').forEach(o=>{if(/^MAT_\d+$/.test(o.value)&&Number(o.value.slice(4))>=68)o.remove()});
 importedMaterials=[];materialSelected=0;try{localStorage.removeItem('chemistryImportedMaterialsV1')}catch(e){}
 $('importStatus').textContent=bilingual('Az importált anyagok törölve.','Importierte Stoffe gelöscht.');renderMaterials();
};
const exampleImport={schemaVersion:1,materials:[{id:'formaldehyde',hu:'Formaldehid',de:'Formaldehyd',f:'CH₂O',category:'szerves',type:'molecule',description:['Egyszerű aldehid; reakcióképes vegyület.','Einfaches, reaktives Aldehyd.'],structure:{kind:'molecule',atoms:[['C',0,0],['O',110,0],['H',-65,-75],['H',-65,75]],edges:[[0,1,2],[0,2,1],[0,3,1]]}}]};
$('exportMaterialsBtn').onclick=()=>{
 const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(exampleImport,null,2)],{type:'application/json'});const u=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='chemistry_materials_example.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),5000);
};
refreshMaterialModelOptions();
try{let saved=localStorage.getItem('chemistryImportedMaterialsV1');if(saved)importLibrary({schemaVersion:1,materials:JSON.parse(saved)},false)}catch(e){$('importStatus').textContent='JSON: '+e.message}

